GPL SOURCE OFFER
===============================================================================

Kiwix tools are distributed as binaries on built drives under GPL-3.0-or-later.
The complete corresponding source for the exact version is available from the
URL above, and on request at:

    https://github.com/threex0/survival-drive/issues

This written offer is valid for three years from the date of the build. Every
build also carries the source of the builder itself in `tools\source.zip`, and
the builder's source is published at the repository above.

The licences of our own code and of each downloaded component are reproduced on
the drive in `LICENSES\`; `LICENSES\NOTICE.md` is generated per build and names
the exact source location of every GPL component.


